= Kazimierz Pużak

Pużak represents Centrum PPS and concentrates on discipline and party organization.

- @party_discipline
- @mobilize_organization
- @root: Return to main

@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Dissent −12 in each of the three factions. It removes no cause of later growth.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'puzak', 'party_discipline').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_party_discipline_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'puzak', 'party_discipline');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.

@mobilize_organization
title: Mobilize the Organization
subtitle: 1 R; the base reach of PPS among the workers +10; campaigns among workers ×1.20 for six months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'puzak', 'mobilize_organization').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_mobilize_organization_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'puzak', 'mobilize_organization');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
